msgid "内存、swap 与 OOM 的目标验证"
msgstr "Target validation of memory, swap, and OOM"

msgid ""
"这些入口用于独占、可丢弃的 ReliefOS 来宾，不是生产启动路径。内核探针源码位于 ``kernel/reliefnt/tools/tests/``；使用正式 SDK 的 "
"``bin/reliefos-musl-cc`` 构建， 不要在宿主上执行来宾压力探针。将构建、宿主测试和内存测量分时进行，并记录 "
"配置、磁盘、内核、模块、initramfs、工作负载和实际平台。单次成功只覆盖实际运行的 配置和用例。"
msgstr ""
"These entry points are for exclusive, disposable ReliefOS guests, not production boot paths. "
"Kernel probe sources are in ``kernel/reliefnt/tools/tests/``; build them with the official SDK's "
"``bin/reliefos-musl-cc`` and do not run guest stress probes on the host. Schedule builds, host "
"tests, and memory measurements separately, and record the configuration, disk, kernel, modules, "
"initramfs, workload, and actual platform. A single successful run covers only the configuration "
"and cases actually exercised."

msgid "来宾探针"
msgstr "Guest probes"

msgid ""
"``memory_lifecycle_guest_probe.c`` 要求 ``uname -s`` 为 ``ReliefNT``。示例在 来宾中运行，文件参数必须是 root ext "
"文件系统中不存在的专用路径："
msgstr ""
"``memory_lifecycle_guest_probe.c`` requires ``uname -s`` to be ``ReliefNT``. Run the example in "
"the guest; the file argument must be a dedicated, nonexistent path on the root ext filesystem:"

msgid ""
"探针在任何锁策略测试之前，用独立 peer 栈执行原始隐式栈的 ``CLONE_VM`` 丢弃与 重访；随后检查私有 fork/COW、共享匿名 "
"fork、普通锁失败后的既有锁、``PROT_NONE`` 固定移动和权限恢复。共享文件首次写测试仅在可将两个 peer 固定到两个实际 CPU 时 运行，否则记录 "
"``LIFECYCLE_SKIP``。两个 peer 的就绪与指定 CPU 不证明首次 fault 精确重叠，也不证明远端 TLB 故障或硬件特性。探针用锁页拒绝丢弃和未锁页可丢弃 "
"进行有限检查，不校验 ``VmLck`` 数值。"
msgstr ""
"Before any locking-policy tests, the probe uses a separate peer stack to discard and revisit the "
"original implicit ``CLONE_VM`` stack. It then checks private fork/COW, shared anonymous fork, "
"existing locks after an ordinary lock failure, fixed moves of ``PROT_NONE`` mappings, and "
"permission restoration. The shared-file first-write test runs only when two peers can be pinned to"
" two actual CPUs; otherwise it records ``LIFECYCLE_SKIP``. Peer readiness and assigned CPUs do not"
" prove precisely overlapping first faults, remote TLB failures, or hardware properties. Limited "
"checks use locked pages refusing discard and unlocked pages allowing discard; they do not validate"
" ``VmLck`` values."

msgid "``poll`` 和 ``pselect`` 用已同步的延迟写入检查空管道不就绪、用户可见的等待与 唤醒、返回的字节和描述符复用；等待时间不证明内核内部的瞬态任务状态。"
msgstr ""
"``poll`` and ``pselect`` use synchronized delayed writes to check that empty pipes are not ready, "
"user-visible waiting and wakeup, returned bytes, and descriptor reuse. Wait duration does not "
"prove transient internal kernel task states."

msgid ""
"可选字节数须为 4096 的倍数、不超过 2 GiB；应根据来宾 ``MemTotal``、已有可用 swap 和宿主内存预算选取。探针写入整个私有映射后，结合标准 ``mincore``、系统级"
" ``pswpout`` 快照及活动 swap，只有在对应操作前观测到非驻留页才检查 fork/COW 与 受保护页的移动、恢复和字节指纹。没有足够非驻留页或相关观察不可用时输出 SKIP， "
"不能当成换页通过；计数器是系统快照而非某个进程的归属证明。"
msgstr ""
"The optional byte count must be a multiple of 4096 and at most 2 GiB; choose it based on guest "
"``MemTotal``, existing usable swap, and the host memory budget. After writing the entire private "
"mapping, the probe combines standard ``mincore``, system-wide ``pswpout`` snapshots, and active "
"swap. It checks fork/COW and protected-page moves, restoration, and byte fingerprints only when "
"nonresident pages were observed before the relevant operation. Insufficient nonresident pages or "
"unavailable observations produce SKIP, not a swap pass. Counters are system snapshots, not proof "
"of attribution to a particular process."

msgid ""
"现有 ``memory_pressure_guest_probe.c`` 可用 ``--expect-nonresident`` 检查更大 "
"工作集的实际非驻留与完整读回；``memory_oom_guest_probe.c`` 的 ``--guest-oom MAX_BYTES TIMEOUT_SECONDS`` "
"对所拥有子进程制造破坏性压力，验证 OOM 信号、计数和后续分配。应按目标环境设置上限并在私有 VM 内显式运行。探针的 编译成功不等于它们已在来宾运行。"
msgstr ""
"The existing ``memory_pressure_guest_probe.c`` can use ``--expect-nonresident`` to check actual "
"nonresidency and complete readback of a larger working set. ``memory_oom_guest_probe.c`` uses "
"``--guest-oom MAX_BYTES TIMEOUT_SECONDS`` to apply destructive pressure to its own child process "
"and validate OOM signals, counters, and subsequent allocation. Set limits for the target "
"environment and run explicitly in a private VM. Successful compilation does not mean these probes "
"have run in a guest."

msgid "QEMU 编排"
msgstr "QEMU orchestration"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_memory_qemu.py`` 消费已有标准磁盘、内核 payload/ESP cohort、所选 ``kernel.sys`` 以及由 SDK 编译好的 "
"lifecycle、pressure 和 OOM 可执行文件。 它在新输出目录内制作私有磁盘并逐项读回载荷；不改写源盘，不编译、不下载、不修改 用户磁盘。每次准备生成随机 nonce。来宾 "
"workload 由调用方提供，它应使用 ``MEMORY_QA_NONCE`` 生成自己的文件名，检查每个命令的返回值并在完成或错误时处理 自己的资源。预置可执行文件的路径为："
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_memory_qemu.py`` consumes an existing standard disk, a kernel payload/ESP cohort, the"
" selected ``kernel.sys``, and SDK-built lifecycle, pressure, and OOM executables. It creates a "
"private disk in a new output directory and reads back each payload item. It does not rewrite the "
"source disk, build, download, or modify user disks. Each preparation generates a random nonce. The"
" caller supplies the guest workload, which should use ``MEMORY_QA_NONCE`` for its filenames, check"
" every command's return value, and handle its own resources on completion or error. Preinstalled "
"executables are located at:"

msgid "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/lifecycle``"
msgstr "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/lifecycle``"

msgid "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/pressure``"
msgstr "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/pressure``"

msgid "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/oom``"
msgstr "``/usr/lib/reliefos/tests/memory/oom``"

msgid "例如，准备并启动一个 BIOS、256 MiB、双 CPU 的 AHCI 来宾："
msgstr "For example, prepare and start a BIOS AHCI guest with 256 MiB and two CPUs:"

msgid ""
"输入磁盘必须有唯一的 ``RELIEFOS_ROOT`` 和 ``RELIEFOS_ESP`` GPT 分区，且尚未 包含待注入的同版本内核树。``--prepare-only`` "
"只生成私有镜像和 ``prepared.json``； 此模式无需 QMP 目录。运行模式仅启动一个工作磁盘，拒绝已存在的 QEMU/VMware 进程，在调用者指定的非 tmpfs 目录创建短 "
"QMP socket，对自己的 VM 设置超时和 RSS 上限，并记录清理状态。请为高 RAM 测试另行选取宿主能够承受的 RSS 限额； 配置的来宾 RAM "
"容量不等于允许它全部触碰宿主内存。工作镜像和日志保留在新输出 目录，目录中的固定锁文件留在 QMP 目录中供后续运行串行化。"
msgstr ""
"The input disk must have unique ``RELIEFOS_ROOT`` and ``RELIEFOS_ESP`` GPT partitions and must not"
" already contain the kernel tree for the release to be injected. ``--prepare-only`` generates only"
" the private image and ``prepared.json``; this mode needs no QMP directory. Run mode starts only "
"one working disk, rejects existing QEMU/VMware processes, creates a short QMP socket in a caller-"
"specified non-tmpfs directory, sets a timeout and RSS limit on its own VM, and records cleanup "
"status. Choose a separate host-tolerable RSS limit for high-RAM tests; configured guest RAM does "
"not authorize touching that full amount of host memory. Working images and logs remain in the new "
"output directory; the fixed lock file in the QMP directory remains there to serialize subsequent "
"runs."

msgid ""
"``result.json`` 的 ``script_completed`` 只说明本次非重复 nonce 的工作负载以零 状态完成、启动标记匹配且没有报告 "
"fatal；``observations`` 列出实际打印的探针 标记与 SKIP。具体 swap 激活、换出、回读、OOM、swapoff 及工作负载正确性仍须由 workload "
"的断言和串口日志证明。此编排不自动设置 swap，也不自动证明高 PFN、 跨 CPU fault 同时发生、VMware、物理硬件或完整 Linux/POSIX 兼容。标准模块高 PFN "
"探针说明见 ReliefNT 的 ``Documentation/core-api/resource-limits.rst``；应记录其 物理地址、实际读写、平台和限制。"
msgstr ""
"``script_completed`` in ``result.json`` means only that this workload, using a unique nonce, "
"completed with status zero, its boot markers matched, and no fatal condition was reported. "
"``observations`` lists the probe markers and SKIPs actually printed. Actual swap activation, swap-"
"out, readback, OOM, swapoff, and workload correctness still require workload assertions and serial"
" logs as evidence. This orchestration does not automatically configure swap or prove high PFNs, "
"simultaneous cross-CPU faults, VMware, physical hardware, or full Linux/POSIX compatibility. For "
"the standard-module high-PFN probe, see ReliefNT's ``Documentation/core-api/resource-limits.rst``;"
" record its physical addresses, actual reads and writes, platform, and limitations."
